.TH TOSTEP 1
.SH NAME
tostep \- write solids as STEP
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tostep
.I part.fold
.br
.B tostep
.IR stream | \-
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Tostep
writes each part of a fold file, or each solid of a stream,
as a manifold solid of one STEP file on the standard output,
in world mm.
A part with a colour is given an AP214 surface style in that colour.
.PP
From a stream it is the last program of a pipe.
A solid is written for each shell.
Source lines left unused by the pipe, and void shells, are refused.
Faces are planes, cylinders, cones, spheres and tori;
ellipses and arcs of circles on spheres are written as several edges
on one curve.
.SH SEE ALSO
fold(5), part(5), smfold(1), tomesh(1)
